# Runtime dependencies of the upstream .NET SDK and PowerShell tarballs (Arch dotnet-runtime depends: glibc, icu, krb5, libgcc,
# libstdc++, libunwind, zlib, openssl). Most are already in base; listed so that the layer stands on its own.
icu
krb5
openssl
zlib
libunwind
gcc-libs
# NativeAOT publish links with clang (already in packages.base) and needs zlib headers, which the zlib package carries.
